@startuml ref-decorator
!include _style.puml
title Decorator - GoF Reference Structure\n(Source: Gamma, Helm, Johnson, Vlissides. Design Patterns. Addison-Wesley, 1995)
interface Component {
  +operation()
}
class ConcreteComponent {
  +operation()
}
abstract class Decorator {
  #component: Component
  +operation()
}
class ConcreteDecorator {
  +operation()
  +addedBehavior()
}
Component <|.. ConcreteComponent
Component <|.. Decorator
Decorator o--> Component
Decorator <|-- ConcreteDecorator
note bottom of Decorator : Wraps a Component; adds behavior\nbefore/after delegating
@enduml
